  "description": "A .NET wrapper for the Microchip MCP2221 USB-to-I2C/UART bridge. Exposes I2C read/write, full SMBus protocol, 4-pin GPIO, 3-channel ADC, 5-bit DAC, chip and NVRAM settings, and access control via extension methods on Mcp2221Handle (SafeHandle). Bundles x86 and x64 native DLLs.",
